OL,5,G1400 Nations Championship
OL,6,     FEngland v Australia (Kick-off
OL,7,     F3.10pm). Mark Pougatch presents
OL,8,     Fall the action from both teams'
OL,9,     Fopening match in the Northern
OL,10,     FHemisphere Series, held at Allianz
OL,11,     FStadium Twickenham. England
OL,12,     Fbounced back from a defeat at the
OL,13,     Fhands of South Africa in the
OL,14,     FSouthern Series with victories
OL,15,     Fover Fiji and Argentina. Australia
OL,16,     Fcomfortably claimed their first
OL,17,     Fwin of the series against Italy
OL,18,     Fafter losses to Ireland and
OL,19,     FFrance. With analysis from Ugo
OL,20,     FMonye and George Gregan, pitchside
OL,21,     Freports by Topsy Ojo, and
OL,22,     Fcommentary from Nick Mullins,
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG2/10
