OL,8,G1800 Millionaire Hot Seat
OL,9,     FJeremy Clarkson hosts a quiz in
OL,10,     Fwhich six hopefuls compete for #1
OL,11,     Fmillion, with only one player at a
OL,12,     Ftime able to take a place in the
OL,13,     FHot Seat and answer
OL,14,     Fmultiple-choice questions to work
OL,15,     Fthe way up the Money Ladder. Each
OL,16,     Fquestion is against the clock and
OL,17,     Fif a player gets one wrong they
OL,18,     Fare eliminated, the Top Prize
OL,19,     Fdrops down, and the next player
OL,20,     Ftakes their place
